      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey im kinda worried about my partner. they have type 1 diabetes and they're acting really weird right now. they keep asking for water constantly and they seem super nauseous and kinda confused... they even said they feel dizzy. their breath smells kind of sweet or like nail polish remover too which is weird. should i just give them more water and have them take a nap? i dont want to wake them up if they just need rest",
